        {
          "index_key": "custom.stage.checkout-payment-latency",
          "schema_version": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "assets": [],
            "draft_status": "published",
            "enable_logs_sample": null,
            "enable_samples": null,
            "escalation_message": "",
            "evaluation_delay": 300,
            "force_delete": null,
            "group_retention_duration": "",
            "groupby_simple_monitor": null,
            "id": "314372444",
            "include_tags": true,
            "locked": false,
            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P3 · Checkout Payment Latency\n**WHAT:** checkout-payment-latency: custom monitor requested by payments.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `stage` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `checkout-api` (api / service, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Service-specific impact declared by the owning team; see the runbook.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** The platform pack applies api-latency-p99 (rate-of-change) to every API. Checkout has a strong weekly traffic shape — Monday morning and Friday evening peaks are 4x the trough — so rate-of-change produces recurring false positives at the shoulders of each peak. `predictive.anomaly: true` selects the seasonal variant (robust/weekly) for THIS service only, which learns the shape instead of reacting to it. The pack monitor stays in place for every other API.\n\n**OWNER:** payments · support 24x7 · this does not page\n**DO THIS NEXT:** Open the runbook. This monitor was requested by payments for a service-specific condition, so the owning team's runbook is authoritative.\n**RUNBOOK:** https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/api-latency-p99.md\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-api-health` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `api-services.stage.checkout-api` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-api-latency` · no error-budget impact (non-production)\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Checkout Payment Latency — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P3. Runbook: https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/api-latency-p99.md\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Checkout Payment Latency — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one. Runbook: https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/api-latency-p99.md\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Checkout Payment Latency\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-api-latency`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
            "monitor_threshold_windows": [],
            "monitor_thresholds": [
              {
                "critical": "1",
                "critical_recovery": "",
                "ok": "",
                "unknown": "",
                "warning": "",
                "warning_recovery": ""
              }
            ],
            "name": "[P3][stage][api] Checkout Payment Latency (critical)",
            "new_group_delay": 300,
            "new_host_delay": 300,
            "no_data_timeframe": 0,
            "notification_preset_name": "",
            "notify_audit": false,
            "notify_by": [],
            "notify_no_data": false,
            "on_missing_data": "",
            "priority": "3",
            "query": "avg(last_30m):anomalies(p95:trace.http.request.duration{env:stage,service:checkout-api} by {service}, 'robust', 3, direction='above', seasonality='weekly') \u003e= 1",
            "renotify_interval": 30,
            "renotify_occurrences": 3,
            "renotify_statuses": [
              "alert"
            ],
            "require_full_window": false,
            "restricted_roles": null,
            "scheduling_options": [],
            "tags": [
              "alert_band:critical",
              "archetype:api-latency-seasonal",
              "automation_ref:diag-api-health",
              "correlation_key:api-services.stage.checkout-api",
              "dedup_key:checkout-api.stage.api-latency-seasonal.checkout-payment-latency",
              "detection:seasonal_anomaly",
              "domain:api",
              "env:stage",
              "failure_domain:api-services",
              "impact_class:degradation",
              "managed_by:terraform",
              "managed_source:self_service",
              "monitor_id:custom.stage.checkout-payment-latency",
              "monitoring_profile:critical",
              "notification_profile:production_critical",
              "owner:payments",
