            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P3 · Security Log Source Stopped Delivering\n**WHAT:** Security Log Source Stopped Delivering: telemetry_health signal detected by threshold analysis.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `stage` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `security-telemetry` (security / log_source, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** The service still functions but measurably worse; a subset of traffic or users is failing.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** Absence of log delivery is binary. A silent security log source is a compliance failure and a blind spot: the control has effectively been removed even though no customer sees it.\n\n**OWNER:** security · support 24x7 · this does not page\n**DO THIS NEXT:** Open the runbook, confirm scope from the group tags, and follow the validation steps. The attached workflow output already contains the standard diagnostics.\n**RUNBOOK:** https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/security-log-source-missing.md\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-security-control` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `security-telemetry.stage.security-telemetry` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-security-telemetry` · no error-budget impact (non-production)\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Security Log Source Stopped Delivering — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P3. Runbook: https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/security-log-source-missing.md\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Security Log Source Stopped Delivering — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one. Runbook: https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/